<title>USA: U.S. 3-, 6-MO BILLS GET RATES OF 5.17, 5.23 PCT.</title>
<headline>U.S. 3-, 6-MO BILLS GET RATES OF 5.17, 5.23 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury's sale of $17.0 billion in three- and six-month bills on Monday produced rates of 5.17 and 5.23 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
